{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-82441","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114494","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-82442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114495","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-114496","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-114497","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-114498","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-114499","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-114500","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-82443","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114501","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-82444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114502","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-114503","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-114504","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-82445","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114505","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-114506","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-82446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114507","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-114508","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-114509","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-82447","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-82448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114510","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-82449","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114511","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-82450","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-82451","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114512","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-82452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114513","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-114514","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-114515","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-82453","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-82454","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114516","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-82455","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114517","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-82456","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82458","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114518","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-114519","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-114520","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-114521","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-82457","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-82459","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114522","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-114523","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-82460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114524","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-82462","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114525","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-114526","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114527","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-82464","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114528","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-114529","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114530","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-82466","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114531","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-114532","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114533","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-82468","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82471","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114534","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-114535","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114536","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-82470","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114537","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-114538","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114539","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-82472","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114540","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-114541","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114542","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-82474","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114543","marks":["code"],"text":"check_prerequisite/3"},{"id":"spn-114544","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-114545","marks":["code"],"text":"{:allow, state}"},{"id":"spn-114546","t